Theme: {{ $json.theme }}
Art style: {{ $json.image_style }}
Pages: {{ $json.page_count }}
{{ $json.user_prompt ? 'Special: ' + $json.user_prompt : '' }}

Rules:
- Hero is always {{ $json.child_name }}
- Language MUST be {{ $json.language_name }}
- 2-4 simple sentences per page
- First page: intro. Last page: happy ending.
- illustration_prompt must be in English

Respond ONLY with this JSON:
{ "title": "title in {{ $json.language_name }}", "pages": [ { "page_number": 1, "text": "page text in {{ $json.language_name }}", "illustration_prompt": "English: {{ $json.child_age }}-year-old child hero named {{ $json.child_name }}, {{ $json.theme }} setting, {{ $json.image_style }} art style, children's book illustration, warm, whimsical" } ] }

